[statement]
Names packages only provide are decided in the order of the walk, not from
the top: `w`, whose candidate `kx` leads down a chain of provided names, is
still decided after `v`, which `app` lists first, and `v` goes to `gk`.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:v w

P:gk
V:1
p:v
k:100

P:kw
V:1
p:v w=1

P:kx
V:1
p:w=1
D:s

P:s1
V:1
p:s=1
D:s2

P:s3
V:1
p:s2=1


[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install gk 1
install kw 1
install app 1
